{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】小一入學自行分配學位結果下周一公布。</p>\n<p>育局指，今年有32104名兒童申請公營小學自行分配學位，當中逾5成6、即18148人獲派位。</p>\n<p>教育局提醒家長下周一上午10時起，可透過電子平台或前往所申請的小學查閱結果，並須於下周三或四學校辦公時間內，到申請的小學為子女辦理註冊手續。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:03:55.659507+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:29:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:33.812742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:57:29.279989+00:00","content_hash":"b655a1e10bf3f601cb3e4572cd5e0b6a1d701c4f0bf0962302a529b24eb7d71e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}